    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Anglers at Lake Lorraine typically target largemouth bass and panfish throughout the fishing season.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://staynorthern.com/lakes/walworth/lake-lorraine"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lake Lorraine reaches a maximum depth of eight feet and has a bottom composed mostly of muck.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://staynorthern.com/lakes/walworth/lake-lorraine"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Public boat landing access makes it easy to launch a boat for a day on Lake Lorraine.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://staynorthern.com/lakes/walworth/lake-lorraine"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Invasive species like curly-leaf pondweed and Eurasian water-milfoil have been documented within Lake Lorraine.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
